WEBVTT

00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:08.101
Open the needle-clamp sketch saved in the last lesson and double-click the sketch in the model tree to edit it

00:00:08.101 --> 00:00:15.801
The panel says "Under-constrained": some degrees of freedom are left — the shape can be dragged, sizes are not fixed

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:22.050
Drag the bottom edge: the whole edge moves, because its distance from the origin is not fixed

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.801
The arc can be dragged bigger or smaller: its radius is not fixed either

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.350
Undo twice (Ctrl+Z) to go back

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:37.040
The colours tell you too: white can still move; when fully constrained everything turns green
